w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-tzIt_SfssQ7kNvwEs90A2&_nc_oc=AdlaY6Ir7czCyuLtsHnSAU1ITJU8RnNgjdvZvwwDv0EwVwq4kb63B8hw4i3p-O8kXDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzRuYeB9Ag9UJBqLA8TBxv3IFw1MhiZylRkkhTZhiyhHw&oe=69BA932A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t-aWc4-1ZkAQ7kNvwH3_W-6&_nc_oc=AdltY2s6KN3MUPMxudRC6o_YfZ3fB_4gElZvKCvf40uGgomX_8YcucGSOag2naCoGDs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyhMU1Bc-dhkUXsG4kvjvCNXRm_gOREmmdj-jAGcBQTwg&oe=69BAA5DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SZFgThz6HAMQ7kNvwGqUh-S&_nc_oc=AdkVMLGtkxCg9BHPNKewfZ7Jl87QmsHBz-PbWjlgV8UZXVBWgg6PJ4LwdjDLA0XSCmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfymMaa6eq5pllKeGI9QNz0sBut2MWERoS5cbm88OEOlHA&oe=69BA94B1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9